    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90083.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "We've been all, of course, talking about and responding to the revelations from Bob Woodward's book about Donald Trump and what he knew about coronavirus going way back to February, that it was deadly, that it was worse than the flu, five times worse, that it was affecting young people as well as older people. All things that he would spend the next weeks and months denying, and he even admitted to Woodward that he wanted to play it down. Talk a little bit about your response.",
