        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Public figures have a moral obligation to communicate accurate health information promptly.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Intentionally minimizing public health threats undermines democratic accountability.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The truthfulness of the book's contents is accepted by the listener without requiring independent verification.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Trump’s admission to Woodward constitutes reliable evidence of his private intentions.",
