    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "And to that point, there really has been an awakening among people who may not have voted before, among Democrats, progressives who maybe didn't vote in the last election. And we're certainly seeing that on the ground in places like Arizona, in places like North Carolina, and certainly in Texas as well, where we see House races, certainly we saw in 2018 an enormous movement and you certainly helped to do that coming close in winning that Senate race, but also House races that moved into the Democratic column. We see more coming for 2020. We even see the presidential race of very competitive and your group, powered by people, working in competitive state house districts also trying to organize to get every single one of the 254 counties of Texas, calling and texting every single Democrat. Talk a little bit about bringing tens of thousands of new voters into the fold, doing the kind of outreach you're doing right now.",
